****************************************
Welcome to LuaSitter
****************************************

LuaSitter is a furniture pose system for Second Life written in SLua
(Lua). It is derived from the source code of AVsitter(TM) and works
with the same notecards. New furniture can name the
notecard LSpos; existing AVpos notecards keep working.

Source code, documentation and updates:
https://github.com/trish-sl/LuaSitter

Notecard command reference (the AVpos/LSpos format is unchanged):
http://avsitter.github.io

LuaSitter is not affiliated with or endorsed by the AVsitter project.

We hope you enjoy using LuaSitter in your creations!
